<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tupperware downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tupperware downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it lowered its recommendation on Tupperware Corp to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-1/8 to 49-7/8 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
